{"id":1010204,"name":"ガオ・取り調べⅣ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"ガオ・取り調べⅣ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1010204]}],"trial":{"trial_id":10204,"stage":"段階4","unlock_time":"2023-04-11 14:00:00","diary1":"あなたとガオは、ベグリーと車を降りる。しかし「村」には、砂の廃墟と枯れた雑草しか残っていなかった。","diary2":"ガオに励まされたベグリーは、この故郷と同じ名のポリーの花が重要な染料であり、今もディスの至る所に咲いていると知った。故郷が無くなっても、この花は故郷の期待や文化、記憶を乗せて様々な場所に飛んでいく。\n　ベグリーは葛藤を解消し、ガオも彼からされた質問の答えを見つけた——彼女は常に故郷の文化を背負っており、本当の意味で故郷から離れたわけではない。彼女がディスに戻ったのは、友人や大切な人がいるからだ。","evidence":[{"ID":260341,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260342,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110204023,"next":null},{"s